    "turn_text": "Well, I want to stay on the Transportation Committee. That is so important for Nevada. I want to be on the highway and the Air Aviation subcommittees. We need to work on I-11 together again. You have been very helpful on that. Some investment and infrastructure I think will be key. We've got to be careful though that it's not an investment that gives the private sector the right to do toll roads because we don't want to charge people to come to Nevada. It's bad enough they're charging them to park in Nevada. We don't want to charge them to get on the roads. But anyway that, and then I will stay on the Veterans Committee because we have a growing number of Veterans in Southern Nevada and we need to be sure that they get the kind of services that they deserve.",
